      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Ghar Ghar is a play house built partly into a wall, a twist on the tree house for sites that are short of space. The purple house has a yellow slide and a tube tunnel, and children climb up, sit inside, crawl through and slide out. It suits city societies and schools where every square foot of open ground counts. The play house is designed for ages 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 children. The product area is 15'2\" x 13'7\" and the safe play area is 20'2\" x 16'7\". Climbing, hanging, sliding and sitting build physical fitness and exploration. The listed colour is Mango Yellow. Our 3-year warranty covers its pipes, moulded parts, laminates and rope. Send us a photo of your wall."
